# Test-only relaxations on top of the repo-root config.
# - Catch2 TEST_CASE/SECTION macros inflate cognitive complexity far beyond what is readable.
# - Tests guard optionals with REQUIRE(opt), which aborts the test case before any access;
#   the checker cannot see through the macro, so every guarded access would be flagged.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -readability-function-cognitive-complexity,
  -bugprone-unchecked-optional-access
